meta {
  name: fx rates
  type: http
  seq: 16
}

get {
  url: {{bff_url}}/api/fx
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Latest USD-based exchange rates, relayed from the enrichment
  service (frankfurter.dev in real mode, embedded fixtures in stub
  mode). Rates are target-units-per-USD and USD is omitted; date is
  the upstream snapshot day. The SPA converts market values
  client-side with these. Nothing stored depends on them: a cold-cache
  failure answers 502 and the app just renders USD.

  Needs a session: run "dev login" first.
}
